      <manualTask name="Review the accounting and NAV outcome"
                   id="_270d0916-ce91-4af8-9912-3a37f9deb103"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_270d0916-ce91-4af8-9912-3a37f9deb103"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-006; CSP-AC-001; CSP-AC-002; CSP-AC-005; CSP-AC-006.
 
Input: Accounting state following a confirmed no-adjustment decision or successfully applied adjustment, together with relevant valuation, lifecycle, maturity, and settlement evidence.
 
Handling: Review the accounting and NAV impact for the applicable event. At maturity and successful settlement, confirm that the existing unrealised valuation balance has been cleared or reclassified under the applicable accounting rules and that the cumulative economic result is reflected as realised P&L with the relevant cash and settlement postings. Identify any remaining inconsistency or unresolved impact.
 
Output: Accepted accounting and NAV outcome, or an unresolved item requiring investigation or escalation.]]></documentation>
