         <documentation id="documentation_59d4a923-3e67-439c-adb7-aab5ab54008e"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-006; CSP-AC-002.
 
Input: Accounting review findings, lifecycle state, valuation state, settlement state, current postings, and supporting evidence.
 
Handling: Assess whether the applicable amendment, cancellation, valuation, maturity, or settlement event requires a reversal, reclassification, correction, or other accounting adjustment. Define the required adjustment and its rationale where applicable. Preserve the distinction between confirmed operational outcomes and unresolved items.
 
Output: No adjustment required, a defined controlled adjustment requirements, or an unresolverd assessment requiring further investigation.]]></documentation>
