      <task name="Post the approved accounting adjustment"
             id="_90cd16c7-37eb-4436-99e6-bbbf17cf72c0"
             isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_90cd16c7-37eb-4436-99e6-bbbf17cf72c0"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-006; CSP-AC-005.
 
Input: Journal or FAP adjustment input approved by a reviewer separate from the maker.
 
Handling: Post the approved adjustment in SYS-FAP. Retain historical postings without overwriting them and make the processing result available for operational review.
 
Output: Adjustment processing result and resulting accounting state, or an accounting-processing exception.]]></documentation>
