      <exclusiveGateway name="Accounting and NAV outcome accepted?"
                         id="_abd72f50-42b7-4b45-9fb7-29cd98810c5f">
         <documentation id="documentation_abd72f50-42b7-4b45-9fb7-29cd98810c5f"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-006; CSP-AC-001; CSP-AC-006.
 
Decision:  Determine whether the applicable accounting and NAV outcome checks have been completed satisfactorily.
 
Yes: The reviewed outcome is accepted and no unresolved issue remains within the scope of this review.
 
No: An inconsistency, missing evidence, or unresolved accounting or NAV impact requires further investigation or escalation.]]></documentation>
