      <manualTask name="Review valuation and accounting results"
                   id="_d315abf7-4edc-447b-a544-4fdacc4f4b6f"
                   isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_d315abf7-4edc-447b-a544-4fdacc4f4b6f"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-006; CSP-AC-001.
 
Input: FAP valuation and accounting results, together with relevant operational and reconciliation evidence.
 
Handling: Review the applicable daily valuation results, unrealised P&L, and derivative asset or liability balances. Identify unexpected signs, classifications, movements, or missing accounting impact. Relate findings to the relevant trade, accounting date, and operational event.
 
Output: Accounting review findings identifying acceptable results and any issues requiring assessment.]]></documentation>
